_8p0_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","book_id":"b-shiji-041","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p024","text":"莊生閒時入見楚王，言「某星宿某，此則害於楚」。楚王素信莊生，曰：「今爲柰何？」莊生曰：「獨以德爲可以除之。」楚王曰：「生休矣，寡人將行之。」王乃使使者封三錢之府。楚貴人驚告朱公長男曰：「王且赦。」曰：「何以也？」曰：「毎王且赦，常封三錢之府。昨暮王使使封之。」朱公長男以爲赦，弟固當出也，重千金虚棄莊生，無所爲也，乃復見莊生。莊生驚曰：「若不去邪？」長男曰：「固未也。初爲事弟，弟今議自赦，故辭生去。」莊生知其意欲復得其金，曰：「若自入室取金。」長男卽自入室取金持去，獨自歡幸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"莊生","kind":"person","person_id":"eqw_b2i_pp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"莊生","kind":"person","person_id":"eqw_b2i_pp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"莊生","kind":"person","person_id":"eqw_b2i_pp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"生","kind":"person","person_id":"eqw_b2i_pp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0081","start":81,"end":84,"surface":"楚貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或未定指代保留；不補名字、世代與個人成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"i