"person","person_id":"eqw_b2i_pp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"莊生","kind":"person","person_id":"eqw_b2i_pp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m024-0223","start":223,"end":225,"surface":"長男","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","book_id":"b-shiji-041","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p025","text":"莊生羞爲兒子所賣，乃入見楚王曰：「臣前言某星事，王言欲以修德報之。今臣出，道路皆言陶之富人朱公之子殺人囚楚，其家多持金錢賂王左右，故王非能恤楚國而赦，乃以朱公子故也。」楚王大怒曰：「寡人雖不德耳，柰何以朱公之子故而施惠乎！」令論殺朱公子，明日遂下赦令。朱公長男竟持其弟喪歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"莊生","kind":"person","person_id":"eqw_b2i_pp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"gkk_c0y_s45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"長男","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m025-0133","start":133,"end":134,"surface":"弟","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0_B","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-041-yue","book_id":"b-shiji-041","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-041-yue"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p026","text":"至，其母及邑人盡哀之，唯朱公獨笑，曰：「吾固知必殺其弟也！彼非不愛其弟，顧有所不能忍者也。是少與我倶，見苦，爲生難，故重棄財。至如少弟者，生而見我富，乘堅驅良逐狡兔，豈知財所從來，故輕棄之，非所惜吝。前日吾所爲欲遣少子，固爲其能棄財故也。而長者不能，故卒以殺其弟，事之理也，無足悲者。吾日夜固以望其喪之來也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"其母","kind":"person","person_id":"44k_ouz_zd0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m026-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"弟","kind":"